WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.078
Learn to recognise that area is measured in square units and select and justify

00:00:05.078 --> 00:00:07.517
referents for the units cm2 or m2

00:00:08.367 --> 00:00:14.271
A floor is covered by 5 rows of 12 equal square tiles. How many square units of area

00:00:14.271 --> 00:00:18.863
does it cover? The answer is 60. Area means count all 60 unit squares.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:24.724
A display mat has 14 rows with 3 square tiles each. How many square units are

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:27.551
covered? Pause and solve it in your exercise book.

00:00:28.367 --> 00:00:32.228
The answer is 42. 14 times 3 equals 42.
